  _periodsDescriptions:
  - period: 0
    description: After a time paradox, this shield is now used as a sled during <b>Prehistory</b>.
  - period: 1
    description: After a time paradox, this shield prevent the Jule Cesar's assassination
      in <b>Antiquity</b>.
  - period: 2
    description: This shield was used by medieval <b>knights</b> to protect themselves
      from opponents strikes.
  - period: 3
    description: After a time paradox, <b>nobles</b> now ask their servants to carry
      them through the city while standing on this shield.
